error: This looks like MySQL EXPLAIN FORMAT=JSON (version 2), but MySQL printed no plan tree for this delete statement: version 2 of FORMAT=JSON (and FORMAT=TREE) only describes statements the iterator executor runs. Use EXPLAIN FORMAT=TRADITIONAL, or SET explain_json_format_version = 1 and run EXPLAIN FORMAT=JSON again. Run EXPLAIN ANALYZE in front of the query (MySQL 8.0.18 and later), or EXPLAIN FORMAT=JSON, or plain EXPLAIN, and paste the whole result including the table borders.
